<title>UK: TABLE - LucasVarity Q1 pretax profit up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - LucasVarity Q1 pretax profit up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.2		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pre-tax		    72		     vs 62</p>
<p> Sales			1.21 bln	     vs 1.11</p>
<p>Note - LucasVarity Plc said that first quarter results are compared to proforma combined results following the merger between Lucas Industries and Varity Corp on September 6, 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
